  "body": "Step into easy, modern living with this beautifully presented three-bedroom home in the sought-after Strathmill neighbourhood. Designed for low-maintenance living, it's an ideal choice for first-home buyers, investors, or those looking to simplify without compromising on comfort.\r\n\r\nMultiple homes are available to view, giving buyers the opportunity to compare layouts and find the home that best suits their lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area creates a welcoming hub for everyday life, flowing effortlessly to the outdoor space where you can enjoy your morning coffee or unwind at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nFeaturing three generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom complete with ensuite, walk in wardrobe and outdoor access, this home offers practical living for families, couples, and professionals alike. An internal-access garage and additional off-street parking provide added convenience.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\n* Three bedrooms, including a master with ensuite and walk in wardrobe\r\n* Master bedroom with ranch slider opening directly to the deck\r\n* Modern open plan kitchen, dining and lounge with great natural light\r\n* Large deck offering easy outdoor living and entertaining\r\n* Single internal-access garage plus one off-street park\r\n* Low maintenance 203 sqm; section, ideal for busy households\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of both convenience and nature in this desirable Strathmill location. You are just minutes from Orewa Beach, local cafes, shops, schools and motorway access. The Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve is approximately a 3.5km walk away. This much-loved local reserve offers tranquil walking tracks through native forest, scenic lookout points and peaceful natural surroundings, providing the perfect place to unwind, explore and enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nLocated in the thriving Strathmill community, this home combines modern comfort with an enviable lifestyle, making it an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact Shaun Burnett on 021 871 252 or Ann Park on 021 151 8458 to learn more or arrange a private viewing.",
